- *Learning to Infer Program Sketches* — `DBLP_journals_corr_abs-1902-06349.pdf` — page 2  
- *Learning to Infer Program Sketches* — `DBLP_conf_icml_NyeHTS19.pdf` — page 2  
- *Learning to Infer Program Sketches* — `DBLP_journals_corr_abs-1902-06349.pdf` — page 1  
